\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q:\\mathcal D\\to\\mathcal B\">\\(q:\\mathcal D\\to\\mathcal B\\)</span> 是带提升选择的纤维化；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B^{\\to}\">\\(\\chi:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B^{\\to}\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CompCat}(p,\\chi)\">\\(\\mathrm{CompCat}(p,\\chi)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega\\in\\mathcal E\">\\(\\Omega\\in\\mathcal E\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\in\\mathcal D\">\\(G\\in\\mathcal D\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CompCat}\">\\(\\mathrm{CompCat}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DepPredSem}\">\\(\\mathrm{DepPredSem}\\)</span> 及完整结构参数采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6fdaaa990a4fe51a\" href=\"?note=6fdaaa990a4fe51a\" title=\"16-df-dep-pred-semantics\">16-df-dep-pred-semantics</a> 的 Hypothesis 与 Assertion。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DepPredSem}_{df}\">\\(\\mathrm{DepPredSem}_{df}\\)</span> (本文件定义的兼容谓词)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dependent\\text{-}predicate\\text{-}semantics}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{DepPredSem}_{df}(p,\\chi,q,\\Omega,G)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{DepPredSem}(p,\\chi,q,\\Omega,G).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dependent\\text{-}predicate\\text{-}semantics}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{DepPredSem}_{df}(p,\\chi,q,\\Omega,G)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{DepPredSem}(p,\\chi,q,\\Omega,G).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>历史问题 J06（2026-10-07，P1）于 2026-10-15 随规范入口完成来源对应修复；保留本文件名作为兼容入口。</li>\n<li>五参数谓词显式携带理解函子、闭高阶类型与泛对象；两条纤维化的共同基底是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B\">\\(\\mathcal B\\)</span>。完整定义只位于 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"6fdaaa990a4fe51a\" href=\"?note=6fdaaa990a4fe51a\" title=\"16-df-dep-pred-semantics\">16-df-dep-pred-semantics</a>。</li>\n<li>来源：Jacobs, <em>Categorical Logic and Type Theory</em>，Definition 11.2.1, printed p. 654 / PDF 第 674 页。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-dep-pred-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"6fdaaa990a4fe51a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-dep-pred-semantics]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-dep-pred-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"6fdaaa990a4fe51a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CompCat}$、$\\mathrm{DepPredSem}$ 及完整结构参数采用 [[16-df-dep-pred-semantics]] 的 Hypothesis 与 Assertion。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-dep-pred-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"6fdaaa990a4fe51a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"五参数谓词显式携带理解函子、闭高阶类型与泛对象；两条纤维化的共同基底是 $\\mathcal B$。完整定义只位于 [[16-df-dep-pred-semantics]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"q:\\mathcal D\\to\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B^{\\to}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CompCat}(p,\\chi)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Omega\\in\\mathcal E","display":false},{"tex":"G\\in\\mathcal D","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CompCat}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DepPredSem}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DepPredSem}_{df}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dependent\\text{-}predicate\\text{-}semantics}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{DepPredSem}_{df}(p,\\chi,q,\\Omega,G)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{DepPredSem}(p,\\chi,q,\\Omega,G).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal B","display":false}],"bytes":1668,"backlinks":